<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS4" title="In IV EXPERIMENTS ‣ Biased-Attention Guided Risk Prediction for Safe Decision-Making at Unsignalized Intersections" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-D</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Ablation experiment</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS5" title="In IV EXPERIMENTS ‣ Biased-Attention Guided Risk Prediction for Safe Decision-Making at Unsignalized Intersections" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-E</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Analysis of the Risk Prediction Model</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Biased-Attention Guided Risk Prediction for Safe Decision-Making at Unsignalized Intersections" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">V </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Conclusion</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Biased-Attention Guided Risk Prediction for Safe Decision-Making at Unsignalized Intersections" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
